------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party software
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

BoothSoft is built with open-source Rust crates, each under its own license
(mostly MIT or Apache-2.0), including: eframe and egui, image, nokhwa, mozjpeg
(libjpeg-turbo / mozjpeg, IJG and BSD-style licenses), fast_image_resize, cpal,
ab_glyph, serde, toml, zip, rfd, chrono, bcrypt, dirs and windows-sys.

The complete list with versions is in Cargo.lock. Run `cargo tree` to inspect
it, and a tool such as `cargo about` or `cargo deny` to produce a full license
report for a binary distribution.

